# Whole plugins / harnesses installed natively via each agent CLI's plugin system.
#
# Unlike APM skills (symlinked per-skill by install.sh), these are full plugins
# that carry hooks, session bootstraps, companion tools, and/or MCP servers that a
# skill-only symlink cannot provide. They are installed with install-plugins.sh.
#
# Format (pipe-delimited):
#   marketplace_repo | marketplace_name | plugin | targets(comma) | description
#
obra/superpowers-marketplace | superpowers-marketplace | superpowers | copilot,claude | Agentic SDLC methodology: brainstorming, TDD, systematic-debugging, code review, git worktrees, with a session-start bootstrap
a-magdy/skills | personal-skills-marketplace | personal-skills | copilot,claude | This repo's own skills (session lifecycle, site design, Danish due diligence) with SessionStart/SessionEnd hooks
